cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the accompanying manuscript."
title: "TACT: Thermal-stress Anchoring for Cross-basin Transfer"
abstract: >-
  TACT (Thermal-stress Anchoring for Cross-basin Transfer) is the
  reproduction package for a study of cross-basin transfer of coral
  thermal-stress risk across the South China Sea, Great Barrier Reef and
  Caribbean. Includes the frozen TSCF classifier, the TSAR anchored-residual
  model, the PersA physical anchor, the six-direction zero-shot transfer
  matrix, seed and prevalence-matched controls, matched-DHW conditional
  analyses, an XGBoost architectural control, and independent GCBD
  ecological validation.
type: software
